JCL_PARAMETER
    : JCL_ACCODE | JCL_ACCT | JCL_ADDRESS | JCL_ADDRSPC | JCL_AFF | JCL_AMP | JCL_AVGREC
    | JCL_BLKSIZE | JCL_BLKSZLIM | JCL_BUFND | JCL_BUFNI | JCL_BUFNO | JCL_BUFSP | JCL_BUILDING | JCL_BURST | JCL_BYTES
    | JCL_CCSID | JCL_CHARS | JCL_CHKPT | JCL_CKPTLINE | JCL_CKPTPAGE | JCL_CKPTSEC | JCL_CLASS | JCL_CNTL
